r_red_doc_es.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Spanish</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/ems/resources/red-doc/truecpr/truecpr_red_doc_sv.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Swedish</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/dam/stryker/ems/resources/red-doc/truecpr/truecpr_red_doc_tr.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Turkish</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
